{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make verbal abuse of call centre workers a specific criminal offence",
        "additional_details": "Most experienced call centre workers understand that things do go wrong. System errors, human error, postal delays can all contribute to a customer's dissatisfaction.\r\n\r\nWhile we have all handled complaints and dissatisfaction, abuse or threats of violence should never be tolerated.\r\n\r\nWe have been customers ourselves, what we wish to see is a law that seeks to criminalise verbal abuse towards us and threats of physical violence towards us.",
        "background": "We are looking for Government to create a specific criminal offence to verbally abuse or threaten call centre workers whilst on duty working on the phone lines.",
